/* A Studio command as a menu item, as the menubar lists them: alias it as
   data-alias-command="commands.<id>". It shows the command's menu label,
   its icon, or a check for a toggle, and its shortcut; it is disabled while
   the command is, and runs it with emit('studio.<id>'). */
body { display: block; }
.menu-item { height: var(--menu-row-h); }
